{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51641","headline":"喜贼平谒李将军祠 · 危仔昌","name":"喜贼平谒李将军祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君向神重谒，天教君亦神。\n十年香火主，百物雨阳身。\n忠在偏诛贼，恩多每济人。\n高歌震霄壑，朝野遍阳春。\n（《上饶县志》二三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"危仔昌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}